<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Community Portal | KAMBAC</title><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/kambac.css"></head><body><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="KAMBAC home"><i>K</i><span>KAMBAC<em>.</em></span></a><nav><a class="optional" href="#about">About KAMBAC</a><a href="/login">Member sign in</a><a class="button" href="/register">Register</a></nav></header><main><section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">&#9679; &nbsp;KAMBAC COMMUNITY PORTAL</div><h1>Working together.<br><span>Growing stronger.</span></h1><p class="intro">Welcome to the KAMBAC Integrated Management System ? a shared space for our agrarian beneficiary farmer community to stay connected and manage product information.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/login">Sign in to your account <span>&rarr;</span></a><a href="/products">Explore products <b>&nearr;</b></a><a href="/register">New to KAMBAC? Register <b>&nearr;</b></a></div><p class="member-note"><span>&rarr;</span> For KAMBAC members, officers, and staff</p></div><div class="art" role="img" aria-label="Sun rising over community farmland"><div class="landscape"><div class="sun"></div><div class="hill"></div><div class="fields"></div></div><div class="art-tag"><b>&nearr;</b> Community first</div><div class="art-caption"><strong>Rooted in community</strong><small>Building a connected future together</small></div></div></section><section id="about" class="about"><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT KAMBAC</div><div><h2>One community, moving forward.</h2><p>A shared space for our members to stay connected and keep product and inventory information organized.</p></div></section></main></body></html>